- Conclusion: zero verified public benchmark numbers for the exact `kimi-k2-8-preview` ID → self-excluded per template SELF-EXCLUSION and `tasks/sync-data.md` QUAR criteria. Nearest publicly verified siblings: K2.7 Code (AA Index 26, 256K) and K3 (AA Index 44, 1.05M).

